TI  - Rigid bronchoscopy-guided percutaneous tracheostomy.
PG  - 417-9
AB  - We describe a case series of seven patients that demonstrates the usefulness of 
      rigid bronchoscopy in percutaneous tracheostomy. The technique was used in 
      selected patients who had a previous tracheostomy, a difficult airway, high risk 
      of bleeding, or a tracheal stent in place.
