DP  - 2020 Jun
TI  - Dilation of tracheal stenosis below tracheostomy tube with Dolphin percutaneous 
      tracheostomy kit : Tracheal stenosis treated with Dolphin PDT.
PG  - 655-658
LID - 10.1007/s11748-020-01311-8 [doi]
AB  - We reported a new minimally invasive procedure to treat tracheal stenosis below 
      tracheostomy tube using standard Ciaglia Blue Dolphin kit for percutaneous 
      tracheostomy. Under endoscopic view, the Dolphin kit was inserted through the 
      stoma into the stenosis; the balloon was inflated until a sufficient tracheal 
      diameter was obtained; then, a longer tracheostomy tube was inserted through the 
      stenosis and the distal tip placed near the carina. This procedure was 
      succesfully applied in seven patients.
